  "bio": "Alex Kopf is a highly skilled tattoo artist renowned for their mastery in black and gray realism. Each piece crafted by Alex is characterized by impeccable detail and individuality, capturing the essence of their client's vision with perfection. Operating out of Forchtenberg on Ziegelsteige 21, Alex maintains a reputation for delivering tattoos that are not only visually stunning but also meticulously executed, making them a sought-after artist for anyone desiring top-tier realistic ink.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n𝐓𝐞𝐫𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐧𝐟𝐫𝐚𝐠𝐞 𝐮̈𝐛𝐞𝐫 𝐖𝐡𝐚𝐭𝐬𝐀𝐩𝐩 𝐁𝐮𝐭𝐭𝐨𝐧 𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐫 𝐋𝐢𝐧𝐤/ 𝐖𝐡𝐚𝐭𝐬𝐀𝐩𝐩\n𝙍𝙚𝙖𝙡𝙞𝙨𝙩𝙞𝙘 | 𝘽𝙡𝙖𝙘𝙠 & 𝙂𝙧𝙚𝙮 | 𝘾𝙤𝙫𝙚𝙧 𝙐𝙥 | 𝘾𝙤𝙡𝙤𝙧 | 𝙒𝙖𝙩𝙚𝙧𝙘𝙤𝙡𝙤𝙧",
